      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm not a doctor, but I can give you some advice. Based on your symptoms, it's likely you've strained a muscle, probably the latissimus dorsi. Taking 800mg of ibuprofen every few hours is a good idea, but I'd recommend adding some rest and ice to the mix. You can also try applying some arnica gel to the affected area to reduce inflammation. If the pain persists or worsens, you might consider taking a few more ibuprofen, but no more than 2400mg in a 24-hour period.",
